Initialize and configure the Kubernetes cluster for MCP platform

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster init [flags]

Flags:
      --context string      Kubernetes context to use
  -h, --help                help for init
      --kubeconfig string   Path to kubeconfig file (default: single-file $KUBECONFIG, else ~/.kube/config; auto-detects /etc/rancher/k3s/k3s.yaml on k3s hosts)

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
